axtb: license
=============

axtb (https://github.com/atomsforhumanity/axtb) is free software under one license,
LGPL-3.0-or-later: the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 3 or (at your option) any
later version. The full texts are in the repository's top directory: COPYING.LESSER (GNU
Lesser General Public License, version 3) and COPYING (GNU General Public License, version 3),
which the LGPL supplements and needs alongside.

The license covers every crate of the workspace and everything built from them, the `axtb`
program and the Python wheels included:
  crates/base        axtb-base       the shared foundation of the crates
  crates/axtb        axtb            GFN2-xTB and the shared machinery
  crates/d4          axtb-d4         DFT-D4 dispersion
  crates/solvation   axtb-solvation  ALPB/GBSA implicit solvation
  crates/gfnff       axtb-gfnff      GFN-FF force field
  crates/gxtb        axtb-gxtb       g-xTB v1.1 and 2.0.1
  crates/driver      axtb-driver     the request/response layer of the front ends
  crates/axtb-cli    axtb-cli        the `axtb` command-line program
  crates/axtb-py     axtb (PyPI)     the Python package and its wheels

The crates reproduce parameters and algorithms of xtb, tblite and dftd4 (LGPL-3.0-or-later)
and data of mctc-lib and multicharge (Apache-2.0). axtb-gxtb also embeds the g-xTB parameters:
the parameter files of the g-xTB 1.1.0 release and tables taken from the g-xTB 1.1.0 and 2.0.1
programs (grimme-lab/g-xtb). g-xTB itself is GPL-3.0; its authors gave axtb explicit
permission to include these parameters and to distribute its g-xTB implementation under
LGPL-3.0-or-later. NOTICE quotes the permission and credits all the upstream work.

Other files
  third_party/   patched copies of two MIT-licensed crates (gemm-common, private-gemm-x86);
                 each keeps its own LICENSE file (third_party/README.md).
  tests/structures/README.md  the source and license of each test structure.

Each published crate carries COPYING, COPYING.LESSER and NOTICE; the Python package carries
these and this file.
